reviewNotes:
Substrate Tasks is a client for Substrate, a personal server its user runs; the app does nothing without one. We run a demonstration server for review with no real user's data.

To sign in:
1. Open the app and tap Sign In with Your Substrate.
2. Under Repository or server, enter {server} and tap Continue in Your Browser.
3. On the server's Sign in to your Substrate page, enter the repository and password below and tap Sign in.
4. Tap Approve and set up. The app returns signed in.

Repository: {user}
Password: {password}

Then create a list and a few tasks. Accounts live on the user's own server and are never created in the app, so there is no in-app account to delete; signing out revokes the app's access on the server. Privacy policy: {privacy}
